ed -> exactly the missing L4 evidence", "x86 CI rerun (this host is loongarch64)"], "audit_report": "docs/audit/m15484_m15362_GAP-PP-2-3DMCMP-LAPLACE_audit.md", "figure": "figures/m15484/laplace_3d_audit.png", "commit_reviewed": "fde9d5df (agent/m15362) / 7657e18f squash / Merge #1800 a085d425", "platform_report_reviewed": "NONE (tensor_reports WHERE mission_id=15362 -> 0 rows)", "entry_note": "main() at :220; --out/--jobs/--quick"}$json$::jsonb,'board-audit') ON CONFLICT (repo, scope, verdict_by) DO UPDATE SET level=EXCLUDED.level, evidence=EXCLUDED.evidence, mission_id=EXCLUDED.mission_id, gate_state='pending', gate_level=NULL, gate_note=NULL RETURNING id, level;
